Initialize GroupIndex before CFilterMode2 is copied into the filter vector.
The index is replaced before it is used, but copying an indeterminate unsigned
member triggers GCC's -Wmaybe-uninitialized and is not valid C++.

--- a/CPP/7zip/Archive/7z/7zUpdate.cpp
+++ b/CPP/7zip/Archive/7z/7zUpdate.cpp
@@ -434,6 +434,7 @@
   {
     ClearFilterMode();
     Encrypted = false;
+    GroupIndex = 0;
   }

   int Compare(const CFilterMode2 &m) const
